# The ánima gym's words: the clue to the ravenous ánimas. Every text in <<...>>
# is still to write; replace it, keep the rest.

== note anima_weakness
intent: What the clue teaches, in the Exsecrator's own pencil: they get on you and drink, lead passes through them, a whip or copal gets them off, and a line of copal holds them back.
text: <<pencil: what the hungry ones fear>>

== readable anima_clue
note: anima_weakness
intent: A curandera's note pinned in the kit room, on the souls no one lights a candle for.
text:
<<the curandera's note on the hungry ones>>
